      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-11-07_WidnesExaminer_art0034" n="art0034">
        <head>COULD NOT WORK through\ stomach and kidney troub:es.</head>
        <p>COULD NOT WORK through\ stomach and kidney troub:es.</p>
        <p>Now quite cured by D. CASSELL'S TABLE rs.</p>
        <p>Mrs. A. Dry, of 15, Prospect Terrace, York, writes : —" For many years I was a martyr to indigestion, flatulence, and kidney troubles. I could not eat or sleep, and on account of the great pan hardly knew what it was to have a night's rest. I lost my strength, and got so thoroughly ran down that I could not do ray work and hid to have some one to help me. After taking Dr. Cassell's Tablets I , gradually gained in strength end health, and now I am A di (fere ot woman. I can enjoy my food, it agrees with me, the pains are all gone. Dr. Cassell's Tablets can be got at any chemist for Is. lid. and 2a. 9d., and are a perfect remedy for nerve, stomach, and kidney troubles.</p>
