      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-11-07_WidnesExaminer_art0046" n="art0046">
        <head>CURE BY CUTICURA SEEMED LIKE MAGIC</head>
        <p>CURE BY CUTICURA SEEMED LIKE MAGIC</p>
        <p>,orcla cannot express the gratitude Cuticura Remedies have done for my daugh- ter, Adelaide. She is fifteen years et age, and had never had anything the matter with her skin until four months Iwo, when an eruption broke out on her chest. The first symptom .., and then followed thicken- ing.and blisters, which would break and run matter. I took her to a doctor, and he pronoun Ced it to be eczema of a very bad form. Ho treated her, but instead of being checked, the diseasc spread. It showed itself on her back, and then quickly spread upwards until the whole of her head was affected, and all her hair had to be cut off. The pain she suffered was excruciating, and what with that and the heat and tin- gling her life was almost unbearable. She became run down in health, and at times was very feverish, languid, and drowsy, and occasionally she was de- lirious. Her nerves were in such a low state that she could not bear to be left. alone. In spite of the cold weather she would insist on having her bedroom, window open, and would lean out on the window-sill. She did not have a proper hour's sleep for many nights. The second doctor we tried afforded her just as little relief as the first, and I really do not know what we should have done if we had not read how Cuticura cured a similar case. I pur- chased Cuticura Soap, Cuticura Oint- . ment, and Cuticura Pills, and before the Ointment was three-quarterg finished_every trace of the disease was one. It really seemed like magic. Her hair is coming en nicely, and I Still apply the Cuticura Ointment as I find it increases the growth wonder- fully. Mrs. T. W. Hyde, 1, Ongaz Place, Brentwood, Essex, Mar. 8, 1907. Send to nearest depot for free Cuff- cura Book on Treatment of Skin Diseases. oakum neinccues ore sold throuebrt the fge Depots: London. 27. (I,llscier. przu,e de Is PatxL Austrun ,T POUR!' DruslT.herd• Oori3-. Boston. w•O• Props.</p>
