      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-11-07_WidnesExaminer_art0089" n="art0089">
        <head>RATS AND MICE.</head>
        <p>RATS AND MICE.</p>
        <p>DANYSZ VIRUS kills</p>
        <p>HARMLESS TO OTHER ANIMALS. A NORTIIWICH TESTIMONIAL.</p>
