40, 3 43, 1 35,5 26, 5 36, 6 23,7 25, 8 15, 32, 11 43 p.m. Sundays 8 37, 10 12 a.m,4 3 854 Outhport-7 50, 9 0, 1915, 1650, 1225, 1 20, 2 40 „55 525, 70,85, 95,10 O. Sundays 90, 0,7 50. a Saturday only. wiTb,elwall-7 51, 8 06, 9 18,9 58, 11 7 a.m. 1 15, 2 9, 2 55, 3 31, 4 19,1) 3 35,6 5, 6 45, 7 35,9 49, kilt`l37 p.m. Sundays. 8, .9 a.m. 229, 719 p.m. a 1,, urdays only. b Saturdays excepted.</p>
