      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-11-07_WidnesExaminer_art0108" n="art0108">
        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN UNION. COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP.</p>
        <p>G. T. P. • O. T. P. *Lancashire 2 3 13 Yorkshire 0 0 0</p>
        <p>*Dewsbury</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN RUGBY LEAGUE. *Leeds</p>
