        <p>Death. CALDWELL—On the 3rd inst.' at Rose Cottage, Lower Walton, Warrington, age 73, Ann Caldwell (widow of the late Peter Caldwell). Interred at Pant Asaph on the 7th inst. R.I.P. IN MEMORIAM. In loving memory of my dear Husband, ARTHIIIi JONES, who died November sth, 1904. Peace, perfect peace, with loved ones far away; In Jesus' keeping we are safe, and they. Fondly remembered by Wife and Family. For Children's at eking Cough at night, Wood's Great Peppermint Cure. Is. lAd., 2s. Dd.—Advt.</p>
